:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Contexto Histórico y de Emisión</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Hermano del Dos Pesos de la misma emisión. El anverso presenta un águila y un retrato militar; el reverso muestra el escudo nacional. Una de las denominaciones más atractivas de la serie de 1915.</p>\n          </section>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:56px auto 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"></div>\n\n        <div id=\"p100\" data-screen-label=\"Cien Pesos\" style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:44px auto 0;\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,28px); color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 4px; text-align:center;\">Cien Pesos</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:17px; font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0 0 28px; text-align:center;\">Pick n.&deg; 345</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 24px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"colombia-republica-1910-100-pesos\"\n            aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete de Cien Pesos\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"uploads/colombia-republica-1910-100-pesos.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"uploads/colombia-republica-1910-100-pesos.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Billete de Cien Pesos de la República de Colombia, anverso con escudo nacional y retrato, reverso con motivo ornamental, Bogotá, agosto de 1910\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"592\"\n                loading=\"lazy\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>\n              Ampliar\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso y reverso &mdash; Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Billete de Cien Pesos ampliado\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"colombia-republica-1910-100-pesos\" hidden style=\"display:none\"\n              style=\"position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:50; background:rgba(5,5,4,0.94); display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\"\n            >\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Cerrar\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"\"\n                  aria-label=\"Alejar\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&minus;</button>\n                <span style=\"min-width:56px;